<title>UK: Equitable Life prices 350 mln stg perpetual bond.</title>
<headline>Equitable Life prices 350 mln stg perpetual bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced</p>
<p>earlier by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EQUITABLE LIFE FINANCE PLC</p>
<p> AMT    350 MLN STG   COUPON     8.00	MATURITY  * PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.549    PAY DATE    06.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     REOFFER    99.549    SPREAD	+90 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
</text>
